@prefix conto: <http://www.semanticweb.org/lvian/ontologies/2024/4/conto#> .
@prefix to: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/TO_> .
@prefix qudt: <http://purl.org/qudt/schema/qudt/> .
@prefix quantitykind: <http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .
@prefix dul: <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix foodon: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_> .
@prefix greg: <http://www.w3.org/ns/time/gregorian#> .
